{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2022-01-27 08:00:00', 'title': 'CHINA AIRLINES AND BOEING ANNOUNCE ORDER FOR FOUR 777 FREIGHTERS', 'text': 'SEATTLE, JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BOEING [NYSE: BA] AND CHINA AIRLINES TODAY ANNOUNCED\xa0THE TAIWAN FLAG CARRIER HAS ORDERED FOUR 777 FREIGHTERS, ADDING TO ITS EXTENSIVE FLEET OF BOEING AIRPLANES. VALUED AT $1.4 BILLION AT LIST PRICES, THE ORDER WILL ENABLE THE AIRLINE TO CAPTURE NEW MARKET OPPORTUNITIES AS GLOBAL AIR CARGO DEMAND CONTINUES TO GROW.'}